{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_03_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:27d6fd712d6da0a21ebc85c7da7cbfc60c70dcc860e81c985e52506717999639",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "几个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:022780b460fcd59987f263b39f2eb0f17c4f8d92783914623a936df28852ad7d",
      "text": "户外活动，是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63c1b0dd78a129a53a96618328044e28be5a86f308a96fdbe9bf9d67debce9b2",
      "text": "是的！在偶像团体的户外活动上，\n要不要来摆个咖啡摊位呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5128374865d75bb335f020b90b1a9e919dad8a7759281c183c6fce304fdcd513",
      "text": "个性丰富的店员，加上美味的料理与红茶。\n以及会为客人讲述旅途故事的店长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81a79b9cdc8f8ccc24bd7787b4621f8cc6147c38ce5d89658c042e667b803033",
      "text": "我们非常希望能邀请现在人气急剧上升中的\nCafe Parade各位前来出店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f64cad118295c0e988ba3c78eb3ba4eedc69af8d69650e282f2f43281a758fb4",
      "text": "居然是户外活动！太厉害了——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa2f7de96d9d03c75013b28141738e13f8122b6af5dd37c7592938c598ad0855",
      "text": "活动啊。应该会聚集很多人，\n在招待上也得拿出干劲才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2656386f8ed5e91c8d694c5a615cf365e308d944d77b50d140740035e40dc808",
      "text": "是的！希望能招待很多很多客人，\n让他们带着幸福的心情享受活动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a841515ca0b12fcce713056dd741242e7cda63fb4bc0e4661873e6b763ac1c",
      "text": "嗯。而且对Cafe Parade来说，\n应该也是个很好的宣传机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4399c0bfbc65c6281b9ca5bc85c745243d4ef9abec31bfe199d4dac66c49ff09",
      "text": "吾亦赞成。以此等吾等精制之暗之食粮，\n震颤光之子民的心灵吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:463e81eec2d22f8157715174f43c5b65371b00d31781a23c822367dc279b154e",
      "text": "好，那就让来参加活动的客人们\n度过一段最美好的时光吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aba7105c0f084178db29abe4ad32f56d081835b069af6d0c50f54e3a53621f8a",
      "text": "既然如此决定，便不得不探究精制术了。\n起行吧，撒旦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
